## 🔒 Sécurité & Hardening

### VPS Infrastructure (Score: 9.6/10)

| Composant | Status | Détail |
|-----------|--------|--------|
| **SSH** | ✅✅ | Port 2222, Root disabled, Keys only |
| **Firewall** | ✅ | UFW active (2222, 80, 443) |
| **Fail2Ban** | ✅ | Active anti-bruteforce |
| **Auto-Updates** | ✅ | unattended-upgrades configured |
| **Backups** | ✅✅ | R2 cloud, GPG encrypted, daily @ 3h |
| **Monitoring** | ✅ | Grafana + Prometheus + cAdvisor |
| **Cron Jobs** | ✅ | Backup @ 3h, Maintenance @ 4h |

### Backups Strategy

**Destination**: Cloudflare R2 (S3-compatible)  
**Encryption**: GPG  
**Frequency**: Daily @ 3h UTC  
**Retention**: Automatic (3+ backups visible)  
**Logs**: `~/SigilOS/logs/backup.log`

```bash
# Dernières exécutions
[Mon Feb  9 03:00:02] ☁️ Upload: sigilos_2026-02-09_03-00-01.sql.gz.gpg ✅
[Tue Feb 10 03:00:02] ☁️ Upload: sigilos_2026-02-10_03-00-01.sql.gz.gpg ✅
[Wed Feb 11 03:00:02] ☁️ Upload: sigilos_2026-02-11_03-00-01.sql.gz.gpg ✅
```

