## 📋 Automation Configurée

### Cron Jobs (VPS)

```bash
# Backup DB (3h UTC = 4h Paris)
0 3 * * * /bin/bash /home/sigiladmin/SigilOS/scripts/backup_db.sh >> /home/sigiladmin/SigilOS/logs/backup.log 2>&1

# Maintenance (4h UTC = 5h Paris)
0 4 * * * /bin/bash /home/sigiladmin/SigilOS/scripts/maintenance.sh >> /home/sigiladmin/SigilOS/logs/maintenance.log 2>&1
```

**Verification**:
```bash
crontab -l  # ✅ Les 2 cron configurés
ls -lh scripts/{backup_db.sh,maintenance.sh}  # ✅ Exécutables
cat logs/backup.log | tail -5  # ✅ Dernière exécution visible
```

